{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港人北上消費成風，深圳部分地區為吸客，推出港人專屬消費券。我們跟隨幾位精打細算的香港老友記，到南山區體驗消費券，究竟有多划算？又有哪些限制？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持：邱建偉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">每當假期前夕，在羅湖口岸，大家都可以感受到人與人之間的「零距離」，這日跟三位粉嶺街坊一起北上。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"1.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jITYAdH7MW1790144602.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">過了關，直落地鐵站，年滿六十可免費入閘。搭一個站就可以血拼，超市逼滿香港人，再次「零距離」。去到南山區，大家多些距離了。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Q8cZlxCh4m1790144720.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">深圳南山區有專屬港人的電子消費券，由當地政府部門合作推出。但要在指定時間上網搶，上午搶不到下午還有機會。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026KavFAO36ME1790144682.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持說：「四點了。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港人</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">稱：「</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">600</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">搶不到，搶到</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">100(</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">消費券</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持也說：「</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">600</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">一按就沒有。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">說：「沒有，一按就沒有，四點搭正一按就沒有。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026uooCIf8XHk1790144650.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">最低金額的消費券，是買滿</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">30</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港元可獲半價，我們每人搶到一張。最划算的就是消費夠</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">1,000</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港元，可減</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">600</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港元，可惜我們三部電話，都是搶不到。或者我們也去商場看看，有沒有值得買的、能否用到。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"6.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UYE0Q4ySQg1790144731.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">想消費，都有限制。要找找哪間能用。為何用消費券都是付全價？</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">售貨員稱：「你這要滿</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">500</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">元才能用，那我先幫你退款。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">說：「拍另一個再來過。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">試多次。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">指：「沒有減到。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">今次是搞混了餐飲和零售消費券。退款，再接再厲。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">表示：「服務態度真好，給你一個讚。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">一波三折，反而拉近大家的距離。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">說：「成功了。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">買完一件意猶未盡。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">說：「不錯。消費券可以用嗎？」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"7.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026n0BkCVXAJ51790144745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">終於一次就成功。</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">埋單計，一團人夾埋平宜了</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">135</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">港元。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">又問：「這張券能用嗎？」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">買夠食夠，原來已度過日間。其實除了南山，在羅湖、福田等，都有類似港人消費券，不過優惠就少些，九折左右。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Wendy</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">直言：「其實優惠多就會來，長者的網絡很厲害，港人購物都是希望優惠，便宜。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T01:39:04.039657+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":795,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}